  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "1. What happens now",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every Technician Utilization download contains all technicians, whatever is ticked in the technician filter. Unticking someone on screen does not remove them from the file, and choosing a download with nobody ticked still produces a full file with a success message."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "2. What should happen instead",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Technician Utilization specification, version 6, requirement S7-R8: \"Every download includes only the technicians that are currently selected in the technician filter, and covers the location(s) currently selected in the location filter.\""
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same specification, Story 7 note S7-N1, says a download chosen with no technician selected should do nothing at all - no file and no message."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "3. How to see it",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Open Reports > Technician Utilization and set the date range to This Year."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Open the technician filter and untick one technician - Andrew Wade was used. The toolbar then reads 28 technicians and his row disappears from the table."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Open the three-dot menu and choose Summary (CSV). Open the file and search for Andrew Wade."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Then untick everybody with \"Clear all\" - the table shows the empty message - and choose Summary (CSV) again."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Exact test data this was seen with: organisation Staging Foothills Group Inc; signed-in user Admin ShopView; active location Staging Heavy Duty - 9919; the other accessible location Staging Lethbridge - 4310; date range This Year (1 January 2026 to 6 August 2026), which returns 29 technicians."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "4. What was actually shown",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "With Andrew Wade unticked, the downloaded spreadsheet still held 29 technician rows including his - 1080.44 hours. The request the page sent for the file carried the dates and the locations but nothing at all about the technician filter."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "With every technician unticked, the download still arrived - the same full 29-row file - and a success message appeared reading \"Success / Data exported successfully.\""
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "5. What was ruled out",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "It is not the filter failing on screen. The row really does disappear and the Summary really does recalculate; it is only the download that ignores it."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "It is not the location or the date range being ignored too. Both are carried into the download correctly, and the file's own heading lines show the right range and locations."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "It is not a stale file from an earlier download. Each file was fetched fresh and its contents read."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "6. How often",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every time, on both the spreadsheet and the PDF."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "7. Where it was seen",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Reports > Technician Utilization, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " "
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Technician Utilization report specification, version 6, requirement S7-R8, which says: \"Every download includes only the technicians that are currently selected in the technician filter, and covers the location(s) currently selected in the location filter.\""
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same specification, requirement S7-N1, covers the empty case: \"If no technician is selected, choosing a download option does nothing: no file downloads and no message appears.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
